---Control the front and back writing of individual bits in the stencil planes.
---
---[<a href="https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/RecoilEngine/blob/master/rts/Lua/LuaOpenGL.cpp#L3800-L3805" target="_blank">source</a>]
---
